window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><i>Never run from a werewolf.</i></p> <p>My life has taught me to expect the unexpected.</p> <p>A serial killer rampaging through the New York Pack? Sure. Why not? But a serial killer who smells like me? That's a heck of a lot more than unexpected.</p> <p>With the Alphas of All poking around and my own Alpha on a rampage to figure out who the murderer is, it becomes a race to see who finds the truth first.</p> <p>I'll find the killer. Or the Alphas will find me. Either way, it's time to face the facts.</p> <p>There's a lot more to being \"Wolfsbane\" than suppressing my pack's shifting. And I'm pretty sure it starts with my freakishly red hair.</p> <p><b>Contains mature themes.</b></p>"; 
